(48, 'Fuggler Baby Fugg 3.5 inch (Screech)', 'Mini-baby Fugglers', 469.00, 'https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fuggler-Baby-Fuggs-3-5-inch-Screech-Soft-Plush-Ugly-Monster-Stuffed-Animal-Toy-by-ZURU_685c89c9-a634-4bcb-ba3a-8afee8b39583.0b063f7b50be80abfb44ef9cf5d1a123.jpeg?odnHeight=2000&odnWidth=2000&odnBg=FFFFFF', 'A tiny loud-looking troublemaker with dramatic energy. Ideal for adding a burst of chaotic personality to your keychains or display.'),
(49, 'Fuggler Baby Fugg 3.5 inch (Reek-O)', 'Mini-baby Fugglers', 469.00, 'https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fuggler-Baby-Fuggs-3-5-inch-Reek-O-Soft-Plush-Ugly-Monster-Stuffed-Animal-Toy-by-ZURU_697a31c4-6dae-445a-a926-6e4649232d52.37b2a45e227ded42c60a120155fcacc6.jpeg?odnHeight=2000&odnWidth=2000&odnBg=FFFFFF', 'A quirky mini monster with a wonderfully weird vibe. Cute, strange, and perfect for anyone who loves tiny plushes with big character.');
